# Mechanical Mobster ({3}): "When this creature enters, exile up to one target card from a graveyard. Target creature you control connives." Bot1 casts and sacrifices Black Lotus
# for {G}{G}{G} (the Lotus is in its graveyard), then casts the Mobster with exactly that mana. The trigger exiles the Lotus from the graveyard and the Mobster connives itself: Bot1
# draws Grizzly Bears and discards Forest, a land, so there is no +1/+1 counter (2/1) and the hand ends as it began minus the cards played.

